{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:UnitalGroebnerBasesChapter.Unital","@type":"LeanModule","name":"UnitalGroebnerBasesChapter.Unital","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Units.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.isUnital","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.isUnital","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/unital.lean#L28-L37","doc":"The **unital condition** for a family of generators with leading\ncoefficients `leadingCoeffs : G → k`: every leading coefficient is a\nunit of the ground ring.\n\nOver a field this is automatic; this mirrors the `isUnital`\npredicate of `QOU.GrobnerShirshov.IsGrobnerShirshovBasis`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}